1
00:00:00,819 --> 00:00:02,399
(Howard(arriving):)Raj, what are you doing here?

2
00:00:02,571 --> 00:00:04,861
(Howard(arriving):)You were supposed to help me
pimp out my Vespa.

3
00:00:05,824 --> 00:00:08,414
(Raj:)Are you under the impression
that we're still friends?

4
00:00:08,577 --> 00:00:09,617
(Howard:)Ugh.

5
00:00:09,786 --> 00:00:13,876
(Howard:)Come on, you're not still grinding
on the kite thing, are you?

6
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,460
(Raj:)It's not just the kite thing.

7
00:00:15,625 --> 00:00:17,625
Every time we go someplace,
you dump me...

8
00:00:17,794 --> 00:00:21,044
...whenever someone pretty comes
even though you don't have a shot.

9
00:00:21,214 --> 00:00:23,214
(Howard:)I had a shot with that jogger.

10
00:00:23,383 --> 00:00:27,183
(Raj:)Fine. Paint green flames
on your little scooter with her.

11
00:00:27,888 --> 00:00:29,888
(Howard:)It's not a little scooter.

12
00:00:30,056 --> 00:00:33,056
It's the second-biggest Vespa
they make!

13
00:00:35,395 --> 00:00:37,315
You're watching football?

14
00:00:37,481 --> 00:00:39,651
(Leonard:)There's no fooling you.

15
00:00:40,734 --> 00:00:44,194
Now, what is this "sacks" statistic
they put up there?

16
00:00:44,362 --> 00:00:47,912
(Howard:)All I know about Saks
is my mother shops there.

17
00:00:50,202 --> 00:00:52,872
(Leonard:)Sacks, sacks.

18
00:00:53,038 --> 00:00:55,538
(Sheldon:)It's football nomenclature
for when a quarterback...

19
00:00:55,707 --> 00:00:57,787
(Sheldon:)...is tackled behind the line
of scrimmage.

20
00:00:57,959 --> 00:01:01,019
(Leonard:)Huh.

